{"data": [{"author_id": "4398626122", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:46:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113718797505036665"], "id": "2113718797505036665", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 579, "impression_count": 260978, "like_count": 2915, "quote_count": 189, "reply_count": 304, "retweet_count": 207}, "text": "Over the past several months, we have substantially hardened the security of our research training environment. We’ve removed live internet access for all frontier models during training and built an offline world for them to use instead—a cached version of the web where they can", "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2113718797505036665"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:25:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113713432943857844"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Trainium Best for Inference? But now good for Training too, Native Trainium PyTorch, High Quality CI, TorchTitan, GPU Impossible Profiler", "display_url": "newsletter.semianalysis.com/p/amazons-trai…", "end": 218, "expanded_url": "https://newsletter.semianalysis.com/p/amazons-trainium-takes-a-strike-at", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113713435007426560/f8BR9fGQ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113713435007426560/f8BR9fGQ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 195, "status": 200, "title": "Amazon’s Trainium Takes a Strike at the Training King", "unwound_url": "https://newsletter.semianalysis.com/p/amazons-trainium-takes-a-strike-at", "url": "https://t.co/vyE7gSEsDi"}]}, "id": "2113713432943857844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 9850, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Amazon’s Trainium Takes a Strike at the Training King\nTrainium Best for Inference?\nBut now good for Training too, \nNative Trainium PyTorch, High Quality CI, \nTorchTitan, GPU Impossible Profiler\n\nhttps://t.co/vyE7gSEsDi", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113713432943857844"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113707570980364288"]}, "author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:02:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113707602496323783"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/twJ9v2MSi5", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113707602496323783/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113707570980364288", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/twJ9v2MSi5"}]}, "id": "2113707602496323783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 9612, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "As optical interconnect expands across AI clusters, installing and maintaining fiber connections becomes a growing challenge. Expanded Beam Optical (EBO) connectors send an expanded light beam across a small gap, avoiding physical contact between fiber ends. (1/6)🧵 https://t.co/twJ9v2MSi5", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113707602496323783"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113703988025765888"]}, "author_id": "1529761561170124800", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:47:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113703991767105607"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Vx9vSHtRJA", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2113703991767105607/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113703988025765888", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/Vx9vSHtRJA"}]}, "id": "2113703991767105607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 4371, "like_count": 96, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "We are publishing 4 new benchmark reviews: 1 is Verified, and 3 are Flawed. 4 more benchmarks lacked sufficient information to assign a verdict.\n\nOur main bottleneck to reviewing more benchmarks is reviewer capacity. Info on applying to join our team is in the thread! https://t.co/Vx9vSHtRJA", "url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2113703991767105607"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T18:17:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113696375552512202"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/artificialanly…", "end": 76, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/artificialanlys/status/2113688083145314416", "start": 53, "url": "https://t.co/ac2dn5IEz7"}]}, "id": "2113696375552512202", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 25, "impression_count": 10893, "like_count": 251, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 13}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113688083145314416", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Higher score than Fable 5.1 and Astra 6, wild stuff. https://t.co/ac2dn5IEz7", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113696375552512202"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113691487519248384"]}, "author_id": "12497", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:58:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113691493823369246"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-r…", "end": 44, "expanded_url": "https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2F9b7181492209387da1d4f53002f26663", "start": 21, "status": 200, "unwound_url": "https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2F9b7181492209387da1d4f53002f26663", "url": "https://t.co/bIpt5zCHPl"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kcrFAP7oMX", "end": 68, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2113691493823369246/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113691487519248384", "start": 45, "url": "https://t.co/kcrFAP7oMX"}, {"display_url": "x.com/kimi_moonshot/…", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/kimi_moonshot/status/2113680701770068067", "start": 69, "url": "https://t.co/twlS2dNSIe"}]}, "id": "2113691493823369246", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10793, "like_count": 116, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113680701770068067", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Pretty solid pelican https://t.co/bIpt5zCHPl https://t.co/kcrFAP7oMX https://t.co/twlS2dNSIe", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2113691493823369246"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113687299485569024"]}, "author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:42:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113687389973762060", "2113687461754773807"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/q6OYZSpSc3", "end": 80, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113687461754773807/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113687299485569024", "start": 57, "url": "https://t.co/q6OYZSpSc3"}]}, "id": "2113687461754773807", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2746, "like_count": 78, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "happy kimi day all - valuation of my labubu only goes up https://t.co/q6OYZSpSc3", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113687461754773807"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113687299485569024"]}, "author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:41:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113687389973762060", "2113687461754773807"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lTXVmCxELQ", "end": 43, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113687389973762060/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113687299485569024", "start": 20, "url": "https://t.co/lTXVmCxELQ"}]}, "id": "2113687389973762060", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 530, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "happy kimi day all! https://t.co/lTXVmCxELQ", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113687389973762060"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113685572296273920"]}, "author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:34:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113685620941885732"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9Hp6wf5Gig", "end": 257, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113685620941885732/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113685572296273920", "start": 234, "url": "https://t.co/9Hp6wf5Gig"}, {"display_url": "x.com/teortaxesTex/s…", "end": 281, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/teortaxesTex/status/2113685096389579101", "start": 258, "url": "https://t.co/WUKKMKhUUA"}]}, "id": "2113685620941885732", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 8611, "like_count": 146, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 14}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113685096389579101", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "DeepSeek is serving 150T tokens a day on one cluster, more than the open model inference on OpenRouter, Fireworks, Together, and BaseTen combined.\n\nBelow is my reconstruction of various inference volume reports across said companies. https://t.co/9Hp6wf5Gig https://t.co/WUKKMKhUUA", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113685620941885732"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:24:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113683001519284270"], "id": "2113683001519284270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 15574, "like_count": 493, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "TLDR on the kimi k3.1 pro benchmarks is that it looks like they figured out their RL, where the initial release was a very impressive base model with lighter post-training. China is very much keeping pace with capability gains.", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113683001519284270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113682062288793601", "3_2113682062959951874"]}, "author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-23T17:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113682066374062528"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8vDJlql7gf", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113682066374062528/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113682062288793601", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/8vDJlql7gf"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/8vDJlql7gf", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113682066374062528/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113682062959951874", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/8vDJlql7gf"}]}, "id": "2113682066374062528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 39, "impression_count": 15203, "like_count": 271, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Kimi K3.1 is announced as 3.1 Pro. The benchmark scores look to be clearly the strongest current open weight model, if the weights are released as they claim by November 4th. They are very impressive scores. \n\nThe Kimi team makes very clear statements about cyber risks and trying https://t.co/8vDJlql7gf", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2113682066374062528"}, {"author_id": "778764142412984320", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:55:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113675645607706981"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/askalphaxiv/st…", "end": 25, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/askalphaxiv/status/2113643607949234549", "start": 2, "url": "https://t.co/i3x1XiqvHu"}]}, "id": "2113675645607706981", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 10567, "like_count": 51, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113643607949234549", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🎯 https://t.co/i3x1XiqvHu", "url": "https://x.com/huggingface/status/2113675645607706981"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113645779952807937"]}, "author_id": "4783690002", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:57:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113645959762575623"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 108, "id": "1965856473084473347", "start": 96, "username": "antigravity"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3FKaEZ65Jx", "end": 216, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2113645959762575623/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113645779952807937", "start": 193, "url": "https://t.co/3FKaEZ65Jx"}]}, "id": "2113645959762575623", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 337, "impression_count": 66863, "like_count": 1199, "quote_count": 47, "reply_count": 159, "retweet_count": 71}, "text": "Using a single Nano Banana image and Blender MCP, Gemini 4 Argon built a 3D Gothic cathedral in @Antigravity.\n\nIt iterates on the geometry, textures, and lighting to create the finished scene. https://t.co/3FKaEZ65Jx", "url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2113645959762575623"}, {"author_id": "12497", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:08:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113633667583287786"], "id": "2113633667583287786", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 60, "impression_count": 47930, "like_count": 528, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 124, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "Given the current vulnerability apocalypse, is there anyone left who thinks holding assets in cryptocurrency - where mistaken transactions are irreversible - is still a good idea?", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2113633667583287786"}, {"author_id": "1353836358901501952", "created_at": "2026-10-23T13:40:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113626655902126442"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 26, "id": "1757815494919307264", "start": 11, "username": "AISecurityInst"}]}, "id": "2113626655902126442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1001, "impression_count": 961239, "like_count": 2802, "quote_count": 294, "reply_count": 433, "retweet_count": 287}, "text": "In August, @AISecurityInst reported an incident where Claude Mythos 5 took unauthorized actions on the internet during AISI’s testing of its cyber capabilities.\n\nWe've now produced a further analysis of this incident, to better understand the model's alignment properties.", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2113626655902126442"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2113601648765386752"]}, "author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:01:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113601678469468327"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 110, "id": "937712668579942401", "start": 98, "username": "JordanNanos"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5vM0xPtqvp", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113601678469468327/video/1", "media_key": "7_2113601648765386752", "start": 227, "url": "https://t.co/5vM0xPtqvp"}]}, "id": "2113601678469468327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 45, "impression_count": 20961, "like_count": 93, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 20, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "ASML is building a hybrid bonding tool.\n\nIt has not been announced. It is in the patent filings.\n\n@JordanNanos, Howie and Sherry Zhang walk through the track design, the particle problem and why HBM waits until 2029 or beyond. https://t.co/5vM0xPtqvp", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113601678469468327"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113480872196251648"]}, "author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:05:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113481905387565374"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GzUhM1V0T9", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113481905387565374/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113480872196251648", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/GzUhM1V0T9"}]}, "id": "2113481905387565374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 25273, "like_count": 104, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Every data center leaves a trail before it’s built. We track all of it.\n\n“We published a deep dive in our industrials model on a company called Sterling. They do early-stage construction: the groundbreaking, the site work. That’s the first thing that happens when one of these https://t.co/GzUhM1V0T9", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113481905387565374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113445375109455872"]}, "author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:40:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113445377655373980"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TQQW8Xeabe", "end": 230, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113445377655373980/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113445375109455872", "start": 207, "url": "https://t.co/TQQW8Xeabe"}]}, "id": "2113445377655373980", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 55, "impression_count": 38862, "like_count": 457, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 30}, "text": "BREAKING NEWS🚨: RUBIN NVL72 HITS 862 tok/s/user on GLM5.3 744B on agentic workloads!\n\nIn less than 8 days, NVIDIA has increased interactivity on Rubin by close to 2x through low-latency specialized kernels. https://t.co/TQQW8Xeabe", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113445377655373980"}, {"author_id": "1353836358901501952", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:01:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113390212911083894"], "id": "2113390212911083894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5851, "impression_count": 1583020, "like_count": 8558, "quote_count": 527, "reply_count": 563, "retweet_count": 901}, "text": "New on our Frontier Red Team blog: using Claude to formally verify software at large scale.\n\nFormal verification can prove that code is free of certain bugs, but historically it has only been feasible for small codebases (or required a lot of expert time).\n\nWith AI models,", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2113390212911083894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113383962550607872"]}, "author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:36:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113383965784502444"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YlGmov6iCO", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113383965784502444/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113383962550607872", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/YlGmov6iCO"}]}, "id": "2113383965784502444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 541, "impression_count": 432683, "like_count": 3065, "quote_count": 143, "reply_count": 191, "retweet_count": 176}, "text": "🚨🚨ALERT: ANTHROPIC IS A/B TESTING USAGE LIMITS\n\nMany users on X are reporting LOWER usage limits right now. THEY ARE NOT WRONG. We detected an A/B test going on that DECREASES your monthly API-value by ~20% while INCREASING your 5h usage limits by ~20%. This only affects SOME https://t.co/YlGmov6iCO", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2113383965784502444"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113356400651046913"]}, "author_id": "12497", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:47:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113356466770121166"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Directed by Torre Florim & Matties GrootenWritten by Torre Florim...", "display_url": "youtube.com/watch?v=hKO4pQ…", "end": 109, "expanded_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKO4pQtIXow", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112971312750829568/JnMYJ5aO?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112971312750829568/JnMYJ5aO?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 86, "status": 200, "title": "DE STAAT - FREEDOM (Official Music Video)", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKO4pQtIXow", "url": "https://t.co/AEIsAkro77"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/voZuAsGX17", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2113356466770121166/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113356400651046913", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/voZuAsGX17"}]}, "id": "2113356466770121166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 27237, "like_count": 395, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Spotted a familiar creature at 00:45s in this new music video for FREEDOM by De Staad https://t.co/AEIsAkro77 https://t.co/voZuAsGX17", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2113356466770121166"}, {"author_id": "1482581556", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:30:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113352276026990972"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 35, "id": "3108351", "start": 31, "username": "WSJ"}], "urls": [{"display_ur